  "description": "\n    ThinkGeo.GisServer turns ThinkGeo.Core layers into ready-to-use HTTP services that any browser-side map client (OpenLayers, Leaflet, MapLibre, ThinkGeo.UI.Blazor, etc.) can consume.\n\n    Endpoints provided:\n     - Vector: MVT (Mapbox vector tiles), GeoJSON, WFS.\n     - Raster: WMS, WMTS, XYZ tile services.\n\n    Targets: .NET 8 (ASP.NET Core).\n    Platforms: Windows, Linux, macOS.\n\n    Depends on ThinkGeo.Core. Pair with the ThinkGeo data extension packages (Gdal, FileGeoDatabase, Oracle, PostgreSql, SqlServer, NauticalCharts, Cad) to feed your services from their respective data formats.\n\n    Commercial product with a free 30-day evaluation. Sign up at https://helpdesk.thinkgeo.com/register and download ProductCenter to start.\n\n    Documentation: https://docs.thinkgeo.com/\n  ",
